entries.reverse

Usage: reverse [OPTIONS] <EXTERNAL-ID>

Arguments:
  <EXTERNAL-ID>  The external_id path argument

Options:
      --input <JSON|@FILE|->  Command input as a JSON object, @FILE to read one, or - for stdin
  -h, --help                  Print help (see more with '--help')
